{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"panlu-e-sr-kai-ershishi-shu","title":"凯上疏陈不遵先帝二十事","accounts":[{"id":"panlu-a-c8402a0ade2722a61a57","label":"裴松之抄列文","text":"皓口诏报凯前表后，凯上疏历数不遵先帝二十事（裴松之得自荆扬来者、抄列于传左之文）","evidence":["panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","panlu-q-c7c4ddcc07c7ed7ea6f5","panlu-q-4f1e45cbe453619fc1a6","panlu-q-53d73535256240978e81","panlu-q-6351ae19dcd2c6534c42","panlu-q-f181985a0da71fa3429b","panlu-q-cc6af78f464b6d7f41ac","panlu-q-76d7bd72294b0d65ded0","panlu-q-d53b32e70443dc410ae0","panlu-q-e28a81e9294dfbf632da","panlu-q-ba364f7f06bbca52eada","panlu-q-dcde9636279974ca741a","panlu-q-a0e2a94a3b66606a9f11","panlu-q-3c7cba7897b68b45546f","panlu-q-72047acdf98737f9a73a","panlu-q-851ae2ed845d49e4c870","panlu-q-906a00ec90e74722ec63","panlu-q-7e0a364b796e5d4a7392","panlu-q-9e6c5571d8780b64ea8b","panlu-q-a58ee7cdb21b8d659336","panlu-q-c2d999307e9675d2cba4","panlu-q-1df0d7133677df956a17","panlu-q-d485c59f2c80ee612f55"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0115","role":"上疏（“凯上疏曰”）","evidence":["panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","panlu-q-c7c4ddcc07c7ed7ea6f5","panlu-q-4f1e45cbe453619fc1a6","panlu-q-53d73535256240978e81","panlu-q-6351ae19dcd2c6534c42","panlu-q-f181985a0da71fa3429b","panlu-q-cc6af78f464b6d7f41ac","panlu-q-76d7bd72294b0d65ded0","panlu-q-d53b32e70443dc410ae0","panlu-q-e28a81e9294dfbf632da","panlu-q-ba364f7f06bbca52eada","panlu-q-dcde9636279974ca741a","panlu-q-a0e2a94a3b66606a9f11","panlu-q-3c7cba7897b68b45546f","panlu-q-72047acdf98737f9a73a","panlu-q-851ae2ed845d49e4c870","panlu-q-906a00ec90e74722ec63","panlu-q-7e0a364b796e5d4a7392","panlu-q-9e6c5571d8780b64ea8b","panlu-q-a58ee7cdb21b8d659336","panlu-q-c2d999307e9675d2cba4","panlu-q-1df0d7133677df956a17","panlu-q-d485c59f2c80ee612f55"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"被谏之君（疏中“陛下”）","evidence":["panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","panlu-q-c7c4ddcc07c7ed7ea6f5","panlu-q-4f1e45cbe453619fc1a6","panlu-q-53d73535256240978e81","panlu-q-6351ae19dcd2c6534c42","panlu-q-f181985a0da71fa3429b","panlu-q-cc6af78f464b6d7f41ac","panlu-q-76d7bd72294b0d65ded0","panlu-q-d53b32e70443dc410ae0","panlu-q-e28a81e9294dfbf632da","panlu-q-ba364f7f06bbca52eada","panlu-q-dcde9636279974ca741a","panlu-q-a0e2a94a3b66606a9f11","panlu-q-3c7cba7897b68b45546f","panlu-q-72047acdf98737f9a73a","panlu-q-851ae2ed845d49e4c870","panlu-q-906a00ec90e74722ec63","panlu-q-7e0a364b796e5d4a7392","panlu-q-9e6c5571d8780b64ea8b","panlu-q-a58ee7cdb21b8d659336","panlu-q-c2d999307e9675d2cba4","panlu-q-1df0d7133677df956a17","panlu-q-d485c59f2c80ee612f55"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"二轮逐段复核登记；原文时间表达保留于引句，不由相邻段落推算。","evidence":["panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","panlu-q-c7c4ddcc07c7ed7ea6f5","panlu-q-4f1e45cbe453619fc1a6","panlu-q-53d73535256240978e81","panlu-q-6351ae19dcd2c6534c42","panlu-q-f181985a0da71fa3429b","panlu-q-cc6af78f464b6d7f41ac","panlu-q-76d7bd72294b0d65ded0","panlu-q-d53b32e70443dc410ae0","panlu-q-e28a81e9294dfbf632da","panlu-q-ba364f7f06bbca52eada","panlu-q-dcde9636279974ca741a","panlu-q-a0e2a94a3b66606a9f11","panlu-q-3c7cba7897b68b45546f","panlu-q-72047acdf98737f9a73a","panlu-q-851ae2ed845d49e4c870","panlu-q-906a00ec90e74722ec63","panlu-q-7e0a364b796e5d4a7392","panlu-q-9e6c5571d8780b64ea8b","panlu-q-a58ee7cdb21b8d659336","panlu-q-c2d999307e9675d2cba4","panlu-q-1df0d7133677df956a17","panlu-q-d485c59f2c80ee612f55"]},"ordering_evidence":"panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","source_order":[61,160,0],"order":10757}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0162","name":"孙皓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0115","name":"陆凯","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"panlu-q-1df0d7133677df956a17","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-cdb56c529fb9b621d8e6","layer":"original","quote":"先帝每察竟解之奏〖52〗，常留心推按；是以狱无冤囚，死者吞声〖53〗。今则违之。是不遵先帝二十也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49},{"id":"panlu-q-3c7cba7897b68b45546f","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-68f70d1b3f886cb0555c","layer":"original","quote":"先帝在时，亦养诸王太子；若取乳母，其夫复役〖40〗；赐与钱财，给其资粮；时遣归来，视其弱息〖41〗。今则不然，夫妇生离，夫故作役〖42〗；儿从后死，家为空户。是不遵先帝十二也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88},{"id":"panlu-q-4f1e45cbe453619fc1a6","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-ab79e212efb531b2fa25","layer":"original","quote":"夫王者之兴，受之于天，修之由德：岂在宫乎〖6〗？而陛下不咨之公辅〖7〗，便盛意驱驰〖8〗；六军流离悲惧，逆犯天地；天地以灾，童歌其谣。纵令陛下一身得安；百姓愁劳，何以用治？此不遵先帝一也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94},{"id":"panlu-q-53d73535256240978e81","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-8d80ee0eed9592edc4dd","layer":"original","quote":"臣闻有国，以贤为本；夏杀龙逢〖9〗，殷获伊挚〖10〗。斯前世之明效，今日之师表也。中常侍王蕃，黄中通理〖11〗，处朝忠謇〖12〗；斯社稷之重镇，大吴之龙逢也。而陛下忿其苦辞〖13〗，恶其直对；枭之殿堂，尸骸暴弃。邦内伤心。有识悲悼：咸以吴国夫差复存〖14〗。先帝亲贤，陛下反之。是陛下不遵先帝二也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":149},{"id":"panlu-q-6351ae19dcd2c6534c42","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-5c66292485ea3a0cb3d7","layer":"original","quote":"臣闻宰相，国之柱也，不可不强；是故汉有萧、曹之佐〖15〗，先帝有顾、步之相〖16〗。而万彧琐才，凡庸之质；昔从家隶，超步紫闼〖17〗：于彧已丰，于器已溢。而陛下爱其细介，不访大趣；荣以尊辅〖18〗，越尚旧臣〖19〗；贤良愤惋，智士赫咤〖20〗。是不遵先帝三也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":163,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"panlu-q-72047acdf98737f9a73a","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-6ea1ae64acf9c5dea5b8","layer":"original","quote":"先帝叹曰：“国以民为本，民以食为天，衣其次也；三者，孤存之于心。”今则不然，农桑并废。是不遵先帝十三也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52},{"id":"panlu-q-76d7bd72294b0d65ded0","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-70e070f82ba664e022ef","layer":"original","quote":"先帝忧劳万机，犹惧有失。陛下临阼以来〖26〗，游戏后宫，眩惑妇女；乃令庶事多旷，下吏容奸。是不遵先帝六也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53},{"id":"panlu-q-7e0a364b796e5d4a7392","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-3cc9fc2b347d3e88d3d6","layer":"original","quote":"夫赏以劝功，罚以禁邪；赏罚不中，则士民散失。今江边将士，死不见哀，劳不见赏。是不遵先帝十六也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"panlu-q-810b81bf3b2464428871","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-124fcbf5d5d950a3e0e0","layer":"original","quote":"何以不可徙乎？”凯上疏曰：","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":62,"end":75},{"id":"panlu-q-851ae2ed845d49e4c870","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-85669b33a8b46f177b68","layer":"original","quote":"先帝简士，不拘卑贱；任之乡闾〖43〗，效之于事；举者不虚，受者不妄。今则不然，浮华者登〖44〗，朋党者进。是不遵先帝十四也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"panlu-q-906a00ec90e74722ec63","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-4a7cc448ab5995382a26","layer":"original","quote":"先帝战士，不给他役；使春惟知农，秋惟收稻；江渚有事，责其死效。今之战士，供给众役，廪赐不赡〖45〗。是不遵先帝十五也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59},{"id":"panlu-q-9e6c5571d8780b64ea8b","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-91080844a78edc6857df","layer":"original","quote":"今在所监司〖46〗，已为烦猥〖47〗；兼有内使〖48〗，扰乱其中；一民十吏，何以堪命？昔景帝时，交阯反乱，实由兹起。是为遵景帝之阙〖49〗，不遵先帝十七也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78},{"id":"panlu-q-a0e2a94a3b66606a9f11","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-7a453ccad3a57c23abd8","layer":"original","quote":"今宫女旷积，而黄门复走州郡，条牒民女〖38〗。有钱则舍〖39〗，无钱则取；怨呼道路，母子死诀。是不遵先帝十一也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":171,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":56},{"id":"panlu-q-a58ee7cdb21b8d659336","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-9acea3ad5c453be27399","layer":"original","quote":"夫校事，吏民之仇也。先帝末年，虽有吕壹、钱钦，寻皆诛夷，以谢百姓。今复张立校曹〖50〗，纵吏言事。是不遵先帝十八也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"panlu-q-ba364f7f06bbca52eada","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-acf7ff36bf367dab9c07","layer":"original","quote":"先帝每宴见群臣，抑损醇醲〖32〗；臣下终日无失慢之尤〖33〗。百僚庶尹〖34〗，并展所陈。而陛下拘以视瞻之敬，惧以不尽之酒〖35〗。夫酒以成礼；过则败德，此无异商辛长夜之饮也〖36〗。是不遵先帝九也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100},{"id":"panlu-q-c2d999307e9675d2cba4","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-05d98109771a8d64d04f","layer":"original","quote":"先帝时，居官者咸久于其位，然后考绩黜陟〖51〗。今州县职司，或莅政无几，便征召迁转；迎新送旧，纷纭道路；伤财害民，于是为甚。是不遵先帝十九也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"panlu-q-c7c4ddcc07c7ed7ea6f5","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-1f33f7e0b53039a160ce","layer":"original","quote":"臣窃见陛下执政以来，阴阳不调，五星失晷〖5〗；职司不忠，奸党相扶：是陛下不遵先帝之所致。﹝一﹞","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"panlu-q-cc6af78f464b6d7f41ac","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2d7839fc8b57039cf776","layer":"original","quote":"昔桀、纣灭由妖妇〖21〗，幽、厉乱在嬖妾〖22〗。先帝鉴之，以为身戒；故左右不置淫邪之色，后房无旷积之女〖23〗。今中宫万数，不备嫔嫱〖24〗；外多鳏夫，女吟于中〖25〗。风雨逆度，正由此起。是不遵先帝五也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104},{"id":"panlu-q-d485c59f2c80ee612f55","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-57ce541b338c845aab45","layer":"original","quote":"若臣言可录，藏之盟府〖54〗；如其虚妄，治臣之罪。愿陛下留意！﹝二﹞","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"panlu-q-d53b32e70443dc410ae0","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-a37354ad6bf58fcdc48b","layer":"original","quote":"先帝笃尚朴素，服不纯丽，宫无高台，物不雕饰；故国富民充，奸盗不作。而陛下征调州郡，竭民财力；土被玄黄〖27〗，宫有朱紫〖28〗。是不遵先帝七也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72},{"id":"panlu-q-dcde9636279974ca741a","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-b63d678545f8ee26875a","layer":"original","quote":"昔汉之桓、灵〖37〗，亲近宦竖，大失民心。今高通、詹廉、羊度，黄门小人；而陛下赏以重爵，权以战兵。若江渚有难，烽燧互起，则度等之武不能御侮，明也。是不遵先帝十也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81},{"id":"panlu-q-e28a81e9294dfbf632da","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-2c19cb332aa045ed19ff","layer":"original","quote":"先帝外仗顾、陆、朱、张〖29〗，内近胡综、薛综，是以庶绩雍熙〖30〗，邦内清肃。今者外非其任，内非其人。陈声、曹辅，斗筲小吏〖31〗；先帝之所弃，而陛下幸之。是不遵先帝八也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87},{"id":"panlu-q-f181985a0da71fa3429b","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-3446e253d8447118aa0b","layer":"original","quote":"先帝爱民，过于婴孩；民无妻者以妾妻之，见单衣者以帛给之，枯骨不收（而取）〔取而〕埋之。而陛下反之。是不遵先帝四也。","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
